{"unit_id":"hellosz__dsh-pets#card-zh","repo":"hellosz/dsh-pets","commit":"bae5bab8ca717f07967d60801b65e16fb47e30da","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Pet Companion 是面向 DSH Web 的宠物伙伴插件，在页面角落显示可拖动的像素宠物，并用动画提示 agent 运行、等待确认、出错或待审查。Host 监听 agent、审批、工具、子代理和工作流事件，提供状态与宠物素材接口；Web 客户端轮询状态并播放对应动画。用户可以切换内置宠物、调整大小、隐藏宠物，也可调用 pet_say 显示简短提示。适合希望直观看到 DSH agent 状态的 Web 用户。基础展示无需额外配置；通知总结仅在已有 deepseek-official provider 时使用。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-pets.mjs:240","dsh-pets.mjs:262","dsh-pets.mjs:344","lib/client.js:568"]}
{"unit_id":"hellosz__dsh-pets#card-en","repo":"hellosz/dsh-pets","commit":"bae5bab8ca717f07967d60801b65e16fb47e30da","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Pet Companion adds a draggable pixel pet to DSH Web. Animations reflect agent activity, including running, waiting, failure, and review. Users can switch pets, resize or hide the overlay, and call pet_say to show a short message.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-pets.mjs:240","dsh-pets.mjs:262","dsh-pets.mjs:344","lib/client.js:568"]}
