{"unit_id":"hellosz__dsh-pets#feature-1","repo":"hellosz/dsh-pets","commit":"bae5bab8ca717f07967d60801b65e16fb47e30da","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Pet Companion 的功能「agent 状态动画」：宠物根据会话状态显示空闲、运行、等待确认、出错或待审查动画。状态由 Host 监听生命周期与审批事件后提供，Web 客户端定时获取并切换动画。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-pets.mjs:240","dsh-pets.mjs:262","lib/client.js:284"]}
{"unit_id":"hellosz__dsh-pets#feature-2","repo":"hellosz/dsh-pets","commit":"bae5bab8ca717f07967d60801b65e16fb47e30da","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Pet Companion 的功能「浮动宠物与外观设置」：Web 页面在 shell.overlay 显示可拖动宠物，并提供宠物选择、尺寸缩放和显示开关，用户可按需调整陪伴组件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:520","lib/client.js:568"]}
