{"unit_id":"hellosz__dsh-pets#caveat-1","repo":"hellosz/dsh-pets","commit":"bae5bab8ca717f07967d60801b65e16fb47e30da","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Pet Companion 在检测到 deepseek-official provider 时会把通知文本交给该 provider 的 deepseek-v4-flash 模型生成短台词；未配置或调用失败时保留原文显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-pets.mjs:130","dsh-pets.mjs:145","dsh-pets.mjs:164"]}
